{"identity_key": "bilibili:1274230184454651922", "source_id": "bilibili", "item_id": "1274230184454651922", "content": "Gamirror收到吹哥的特别感谢啦！\n《沉星之序》全篇中文配音已正式登陆Steam！吹哥近日在社媒上分享了这一好消息，并特别感谢了Gamirror Games对中文配音工作的支持！（没错没错就是我们😎）\n\n在评论区，吹哥表示，这是他第一次为一款游戏加入多种配音语言，直呼“太酷了！”，同时也分享了制作过程中遇到的一些技术挑战。\n\n感谢Thekla, Inc.与@ArcGames 的信任与合作，也感谢所有支持《沉星之序》的玩家们！\n\n还没体验中文配音的小伙伴，记得更新Steam版本，听听熟悉的角色们用中文说话吧！🎙️", "publisher": "GamirrorGames", "canonical_url": "https://www.bilibili.com/opus/1274230184454651922", "published_at": "2026-11-24T11:03:54+00:00", "published_precision": "second", "fetched_at": "2026-11-24T15:25:39.520629+00:00", "media": [{"type": "image", "url": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/b90e8610d668fe28c33319c53a66bc76298686071.png"}, {"type": "image", "url": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/8e26211aba672f14ede32f1b97d74f4d298686071.png"}], "metadata": {"account": "bili_298686071", "uid": "298686071", "dynamic_type": "DYNAMIC_TYPE_DRAW", "title": "Gamirror收到吹哥的特别感谢啦！", "is_retweet": false, "is_reply": false, "is_quote": false, "stats": {"likes": 35, "retweets": 0, "replies": 0}, "provider": "web-dynamic/feed-space", "route": "anonymous-buvid", "tag": "B站Gal"}}
{"identity_key": "bilibili:1274232250354892850", "source_id": "bilibili", "item_id": "1274232250354892850", "content": "这星期，新【双人卡】来了！\n【重要键闻预告】\n这周五，《 #HEAVEN BURNS RED# 》日服·繁中服·韩服将带来一张新的【齐奏战型（“双人卡”）】！！！！！\n\n本周四播出的新一期绯染情报局将介绍这张新卡，且会邀请 新卡相关角色 的配音声优！\n\n除了新“双人卡”，这期情报局还将介绍\n· 将于本周五率先在日服·繁中服·韩服上线的神秘的全新内容“部队同步”！\n· 日服·繁中服·韩服这边直到日服五周年（～2026年2月）前的 内容更新计划 ！\n\n#绯染天空# #炽焰天穹# #红烧天堂#", "publisher": "StuartRiki_鍵視", "canonical_url": "https://www.bilibili.com/opus/1274232250354892850", "published_at": "2026-11-24T11:11:55+00:00", "published_precision": "second", "fetched_at": "2026-11-24T15:25:39.520629+00:00", "media": [{"type": "image", "url": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/38d5da50323ede060c7e2e5c52dcbdd039471072.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "url": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/c131e4000634c987a142277ba3430ad939471072.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "url": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/3d3fc480b21f5c1fd71ddfb77c5cbdc639471072.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "url": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/abc070981af144348a924643a315b06f39471072.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "url": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/f019f26a2b69ce4e0309da5980bd323e39471072.jpg"}], "metadata": {"account": "bili_39471072", "uid": "39471072", "dynamic_type": "DYNAMIC_TYPE_DRAW", "title": "这星期，新【双人卡】来了！", "is_retweet": false, "is_reply": false, "is_quote": false, "stats": {"likes": 128, "retweets": 3, "replies": 55}, "provider": "web-dynamic/feed-space", "route": "anonymous-buvid", "tag": "B站Gal"}}
{"identity_key": "bilibili:1274260105334882323", "source_id": "bilibili", "item_id": "1274260105334882323", "content": "《游魂2-you're the only one-》国际中文版现正于Steam促销热卖中！仅需23元即可入手！\nhttps://store.steampowered.com/app/552280\n\n本作是日本知名美少女ADV厂商 Lump of Sugar 旗下名作《游魂》的续篇。 内置简体中文与繁体中文双版本，并且支持STEAM集换卡牌等功能，也支持大量额外内容！\n\n《游魂2-you're the only one-》是由知名美少女游戏品牌Lump of Sugar（方糖社）制作的一款奇幻恋爱题材作品。也是高人气作品《游魂-Kiss on my Deity-》时隔8年推出正统续作。本作仍由前作原画师萌木原文武担当原画人设，剧情则在继承原有世界观基础上引入新角色与故事，同时又妥善照顾了玩家的情怀面让前作主角们悉数登场。精致美丽的原画，波折甜蜜的故事，绘声绘色的配音，相信无论是新老玩家都能够体会到精美的音画文带来的烈似酒，苦作药，淡如水，甘若蜜的独特体验。\n\n#HIKARIFIELD# #GALGAME# #GAL# #游戏# #STEAM游戏# #STEAM#  #视觉小说类游戏# #视觉小说#", "publisher": "HIKARI-FIELD", "canonical_url": "https://www.bilibili.com/opus/1274260105334882323", "published_at": "2026-11-24T13:00:00+00:00", "published_precision": "second", "fetched_at": "2026-11-24T15:25:39.520629+00:00", "media": [{"type": "image", "url": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/b365fff388f9c88d84a7d235f775730041883712.jpg"}], "metadata": {"account": "bili_41883712", "uid": "41883712", "dynamic_type": "DYNAMIC_TYPE_DRAW", "title": "", "is_retweet": false, "is_reply": false, "is_quote": false, "stats": {"likes": 159, "retweets": 0, "replies": 3}, "provider": "web-dynamic/feed-space", "route": "anonymous-buvid", "tag": "B站Gal"}}
